OL,3,GNEWSA'Shock' as new ornamental bench
OL,4,Avandalised
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunity members have expressed
OL,7,F"shock" and "disappointment" following
OL,8,Fthe vandalism of an ornamental bench,
OL,9,Fwhich was only installed five months
OL,10,Fago.
OL,12,FTwo large metal horns have been ripped
OL,13,Foff the bench in Amesbury which is in
OL,14,Fthe shape of an auroch, a large extinct
OL,15,Fbovine that used to roam south
OL,16,FWiltshire thousands of years ago.
OL,18,FPolice are investigating the incident,
OL,19,Fwhich caused an estimated #1,000 of
OL,20,Fdamage and took place on Thursday
OL,21,Fmorning outside the local history
OL,22,Fcentre.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
