OL,3,GNEWSA'Shock' as new ornamental bench
OL,4,Avandalised
OL,5,
OL,6,FCentre co-chair Andy Doig said that the
OL,7,F"horns make the bench what it is" and
OL,8,Fthat he was "really shocked" that
OL,9,Fanyone would choose to vandalise it.
